      "message": "Patch Set 2:\n\n(9 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nSome concerns, see inline comments; the three defects need a refresh, and the minors can ride along. test11 hashes only FID, mode, nlink and path, so nothing checks the rebuilt LOV/LMV/HSM/SOM EAs or li_rdev against what a device stream sends, and no case has the walk return an error (for example an unreadable subdirectory). Should test11 cover those, along with the -EOVERFLOW path?",
